# Sunpetal Grove: "This land enters tapped unless you control a Forest or a Plains." (CR 614.1d): the Plains half of the
# condition on its own - beside Bot1's Plains, with no Forest anywhere, the Grove enters untapped on turn 3.

[Bot1 Deck]
Plains
Sunpetal Grove
Swamp x12

